      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:7:4:1",
      "text": [
        " شُرْبُ الْمَاءِ مِنْ قِيَامٍ بِالنَّهَارِ أَقْوَى وَ أَصَحُّ لِلْبَدَنِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Al Nowfaly, from Al Sakuny, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Drinking the water whilst standing at daytime is strengthening and corrective for the body’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from al-Nawfaliy from al-Sakuniy who has said the following: “Abu ‘ Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ’During the day drinking water when standing gives the body more power and good health.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
